        "zh-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "745e8d7f-3d8d-3f95-b3de-5134d2105453",
                "word": "Monaco",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0a450d3-3e55-3c39-8ecf-b9a3a0f0435c",
                        "entry_id": "745e8d7f-3d8d-3f95-b3de-5134d2105453",
                        "glosses": [
                            "摩納哥（位於西歐的城邦，在地中海沿岸，三面被法國包圍；官方名稱：Principality of Monaco）"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95f8af7b-646c-41d9-accb-1eb2c708fc26",
                                "sense_id": "b0a450d3-3e55-3c39-8ecf-b9a3a0f0435c",
                                "text": "[…]they determined to aſſayle the borough of Monaco, whiche Lucian Grimault poſſeſſed, eyther in regarde of a common hatred borne againſt all gentlemen of Genes, or els for that the borowe is of great importance for the citie, hauing his ſituation vpon the ſea in a place of great conueniencie: or at leaſt for certaine particular hatreds, ſince he to whome falleth the power and government of that place, abſteineth very hardly from pyracies and robbing by the ſea, the ſituation giving fauoar and oportunitie to ſuche actions: or laſtly, becauſe (as they ſuggeſted) that borough apperteined rightfully to the common weale.",
                                "translation": "……他們決定攻打盧西安·格里莫（Lucian Grimault）佔領的摩納哥市鎮，要麼是因為對所有熱那亞（Genes）貴族的普遍仇恨，要麼是因為該市鎮對這座城市極為重要，其地處海濱，位置極其便利；又或至少出於某些特定的仇恨，因為掌控該地權力與統治權的人，很難不從事海盜和海上劫掠行為，其地理位置為此類行動提供了掩護與機會；最後，則是因為（正如他們所稱）該市鎮理應屬於共和國。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6151cb48-7832-4d30-a1fd-c6aa71878f8e",
                                "sense_id": "b0a450d3-3e55-3c39-8ecf-b9a3a0f0435c",
                                "text": "The Republick of Genoua poſſeſſeth the Eaſtern and Weſtern Coaſts of Genoua, formerly called Liguria, where are Genoua, Savona, Noli, Ventimiglia, Genoua's &c. 2. The Iſle of Corſe. That of Capaia.\n4. The Marquiſate of Final, bought in 1712 from the Emperor for 1200000 Crowns; but the Principality of Monaco belongs to a particular Prince under the Protection of France; and that of Oneglia belongs to the Duke of Savoy.",
                                "translation": "熱那亞共和國擁有熱那亞的東、西海岸（舊稱利古里亞），包含熱那亞、薩沃納、諾利、文蒂米利亞等地。2. 科西嘉島。卡帕伊亞島。\n4. 菲納萊侯國，1712年以120萬克朗向皇帝買下；但摩納哥公國屬於一位受法國保護的特定親王；而奧內利亞則屬於薩伏依公爵。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7033ec7f-0769-49d3-ae23-ce2324af8d07",
                                "sense_id": "b0a450d3-3e55-3c39-8ecf-b9a3a0f0435c",
                                "text": "Holly followed the Italian coast up to Monaco, and from there across the Alps to France.",
                                "translation": "霍莉沿著義大利海岸北上抵達摩納哥，並從那裡越過阿爾卑斯山進入法國。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ]
    }
